<title>USA: Butler unit buys door/storefront supplier.</title>
<headline>Butler unit buys door/storefront supplier.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Butler Manufacturing Co said Thursday its Vistawall Architectural Products division acquired the assets of Rebco West Inc, of Rancho Cucamonga, California.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Rebco West manufactures and distributes entrance doors and storefront products.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
